# spec: the QC45 uses the prince's 47-byte ModeConfig layout, which has no ANC toggle byte, so switching ANC is refused before anything is sent.
# source: qc_prince config and its docstring (the 47/39-byte layout lacks the ancToggle byte); qc45 shares that layout (docs/quietcomfort-45-duran.md)
device qc45
call set_anc off
result err unsupported
